  "details": "VRC_Stations in 665 rly weird, here some sandbox samples:\n\n№1: Beds.\nhttps://youtu.be/mMLbPU9G17Y\nThat beds from my world was working well on prev version of open-beta-2017 and earlier but got broken now. It's simple inclined stations w/o any special animators or something. All stations on a bed share same exit point transform. As you can see, player leaves fine when you sit on vertiaclly orientated station, but when player sit on horisontally orientated bedplace, then exits, it's spawns player about ~2m above. This causes player to stuck into walls and ceiling in out of sandbox real cases.\n\n№2: Stools. \nhttps://youtu.be/lwxncAWJqpc\nSame as beds. It's on rigid body comparing to static beds. If player places stool vertically it's fine. If it's horisontaly it's also spawns you about ~1..1.5m above exit point. This also causes troubles.\n\n№3: Bath.\nhttps://youtu.be/0KH_pZhwD4I\nThis one breaks player's capsule. It's have 2 stations: inclined and not. Not inclined works well.  Inclined also inclines player capsule, so WASD controls and camera orientation compleatly breaks and missmatch. Also note player leaves place 2m above.\n\nI tried to switch Player Mobility modes and rotate exit transforms in different ways to try achive stable exit behaivor, but I wasn't able too.\n\nPls try to fix that before releasing update into main branch.",
